{"id":"dead-sea","name":"Dead Sea","qid":"Q23883","country":"Israel; Jordan; Palestine","locality":"Israel, Jordan","lat":"31.5207","lon":"35.4845","built":"","year":null,"year_text":"","century":"","era":"Natural formations","period":"","date_basis":"","style":"","heritage":"","type":"hypersaline lake; endorheic lake","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dead_Sea","text":"The Dead Sea (Arabic: اَلْبَحْر الْمَيِّت, romanized: al-Baḥr al-Mayyit; or اَلْبَحْر الْمَيْت, al-Baḥr al-Mayt; Hebrew: יַם הַמֶּלַח, romanized: Yam hamMelaḥ), also known by other names, is a landlocked salt lake bordered by Jordan to the east, the West Bank to the west and Israel to the southwest. It lies in the endorheic basin of the Jordan Rift Valley, and its main tributary is the Jordan River. As of 2025, the lake's surface is 439.78 metres (1,443 ft) below sea level, making its shores the lowest land-based elevation on Earth.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dead_Sea","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[{"id":"gh-ab8ca2f0f755","w":626,"h":1200,"title":"Dead sea.jpg","o":"gh-ab8ca2f0f755.jpg","credit":{"text":"NASA, earthobservatory, https://earthobservatory.nasa.gov","license":"Public domain","license_url":"","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dead_sea.jpg","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}},{"id":"gh-b8ac4185e633","w":1200,"h":900,"title":"Dead Sea by David Shankbone.jpg","o":"gh-b8ac4185e633.jpg","credit":{"text":"David Shankbone","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","license_url":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dead_Sea_by_David_Shankbone.jpg","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}}],"depictions":[{"id":"civilization-vi--dead-sea","game":"civilization-vi","name":"Dead Sea","verified":false,"text":"","text_source":"","text_license":"","images":[{"id":"gh-p30c730571b9","w":584,"h":502,"o":"gh-p30c730571b9.png","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VI, © 2K; Aspyr.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Historic_Moment_Dead_Sea_(Civ6).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by Xanthos of Thebes on 2020-07-15"}},{"id":"gh-p4848722f308","w":1200,"h":675,"o":"gh-p4848722f308.png","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VI, © 2K; Aspyr.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Natural_Wonder_Dead_Sea_closeup_(Civ6).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by Xanthos of Thebes on 2018-04-13"}},{"id":"gh-p627aa305b6e","w":1200,"h":675,"o":"gh-p627aa305b6e.png","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VI, © 2K; Aspyr.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Natural_Wonder_Dead_Sea_(Civ6).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by Xanthos of Thebes on 2020-07-18"}}]}]}